<p>After spending so much time and effort on my own website over the last decade, I decided to put my experience to use and build the static site you are visiting right now, a site that is easy to maintain and which costs just a few cents each month to run.</p>
<p>If you are interested in creating your own static site, the code for my entire website is available on GitHub here: <a href="https://github.com/Nikkinoodl/PBSB">https://github.com/Nikkinoodl/PBSB</a>. I've also provided comprehensive instructions on how it works and how to put your own version into production:  <a href="https://github.com/Nikkinoodl/PBSB/blob/main/BUILDING-A-STATIC-WEBSITE.md">https://github.com/Nikkinoodl/PBSB/blob/main/BUILDING-A-STATIC-WEBSITE.md</a>.</p>
<p>Please get in touch using the contact form if you need help with migrating data from an old website, website hosting or additional development.</p>
